<section class="cr-s cr-in"><div class="cr-w cr-in-g"><h2 class="rv">A bag is only beautiful if it is <em>comfortable to carry</em>.</h2><div class="rv"><p class="cr-lead">How you carry changes how a bag looks, how it wears and how your shoulders feel at the end of the day. We explore every way to carry, and how to keep the load kind.</p><div class="cr-in-n stg"><div class="rv"><b data-count="5">5</b><span>ways to carry</span></div><div class="rv"><b data-count="10">10</b><small>%</small><span>of body weight: a sensible limit</span></div><div class="rv"><b data-count="2">2</b><span>shoulders: switch often</span></div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="cr-s cr-cs" id="carry"><div class="cr-w cr-cs-g"><div class="cr-cs-v"><svg viewBox="0 0 240 420" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="120" cy="50" r="26" class="bd"/><path d="M120 76v150M120 226l-34 150M120 226l34 150" class="bd"/><path id="cs-la" class="bd"/><path id="cs-ra" class="bd"/><path id="cs-st" class="stp"/><rect id="cs-bg" width="56" height="44" rx="8" class="bg"/></svg></div><div><p class="cr-ey">Carry studio</p><h2 class="rv">Five ways to carry</h2><div class="cr-cs-b" role="tablist" aria-label="Carry style"><button role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-i="0">In hand</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-i="1">Crook of the arm</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-i="2">Shoulder</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-i="3">Crossbody</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-i="4">On the back</button></div><div class="cr-cs-o" id="cs-o" aria-live="polite"></div><figure class="cr-cs-i rv rv-c"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524498250077-390f9e378fc0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=640&h=380&q=75" alt="a person carrying a teal leather bag" width="640" height="380" loading="lazy"></figure></div></div></section>

<section class="cr-s cr-wt" id="weight"><div class="cr-w cr-wt-g"><div><p class="cr-ey">Bag weigher</p><h2 class="rv">What is in your bag?</h2><p class="cr-p">Tick what you carry on a normal day. We will weigh it and suggest the kindest way to carry it.</p><div class="cr-items" id="wt-i"></div></div><div class="cr-wt-o"><svg viewBox="0 0 260 150" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 130a110 110 0 0 1 220 0" class="gtr"/><path d="M20 130a110 110 0 0 1 220 0" class="gfl" id="wt-arc" pathLength="100"/><line x1="130" y1="130" x2="130" y2="40" class="gnd" id="wt-n"/><circle cx="130" cy="130" r="7" fill="#2A1E19"/></svg><b id="wt-g">0 g</b><p id="wt-t" aria-live="polite"></p><figure class="cr-wt-i rv rv-c"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578947493787-429551020d91?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=340&q=75" alt="a beige tote bag held in hand" width="520" height="340" loading="lazy"></figure></div></div></section>

